Hint:\(e = -\dfrac{d\phi}{dt}\)

Step:Find the average thermal energy dissipated in the loop in one period.
Given:\(A = 1~\text{m}^2, B = \sin(100 t)\)
The flux through circular loop is given by;
\(\phi = BA = \sin(100 t)\)
The magnitude of induced emf in the circular loop is given by;
\(e = \dfrac{d\phi}{dt}= 100\cos(100t)\)
The time period of the oscillation is given by;
\(T = \dfrac{2\pi}{\omega}= \dfrac{2\pi}{100} = \dfrac{\pi}{50}~\text{s}\)
The thermal energy dissipated is given by;
\(P = \dfrac{e^2}{R} = \dfrac{(100)^2\cos^2(100t)}{100}= {100\cos^2(100t)}\)
The thermal energy dissipated in one time period is given by;
\(Q = 100 \int^{{\pi}/{50}}_{0}\cos^2(100t)dt\)
\(\Rightarrow Q = 100\int^{\pi/50}_{0} \left(\dfrac{1+\cos200 t}{2}\right)dt\)
\(\Rightarrow Q = 100 \times \dfrac{\pi}{100} = \pi\)
Hence, option (3) is the correct answer.<div style="margin-top:1.25rem; padding:0.85rem 1rem; background:var(--bg-secondary); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;"><div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.6rem; font-weight:600; font-size:0.88rem;"><span>📊 Student Attempt Analytics</span><span style="padding:2px 8px; border-radius:12px; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; background:rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color:#d97706;">🟡 Medium · 55% Got This Correct</span></div><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0.5rem; text-align:center; font-size:0.82rem;"><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(1)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">14%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(2)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">24%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.12); border:1.5px solid #22c55e;"><div style="color:#16a34a; font-weight:700;">(3) ✓</div><div style="font-weight:800; color:#16a34a; margin-top:2px;">56%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(4)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">8%</div></div></div></div>

