Hint:\(\varepsilon =-L\left(\frac{di}{dt}\right) \)

Step:Find the self inductance of the coil.
The induced EMF is given by;
\(\varepsilon =-L\left(\frac{di}{dt}\right) \)
Rearrange the above equation;
\(L=-\varepsilon\frac{dt}{di}\)
Substitute the known values;
\(L=-50\times\frac{0.1-0}{2-5}=1.67~\text{H}\)
